<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Rapid Investment</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Rapid Investment Group</strong> evaluates investment opportunities across multiple sectors, running due diligence on deal flow that moves fast and doesn't wait for slow research cycles. Their analysts need to synthesize financials, market data, and risk factors under real time pressure.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Manual due diligence meant analysts spent most of their time gathering and cross-referencing information rather than actually evaluating it. Time-sensitive opportunities were sometimes missed simply because the research couldn't be completed fast enough.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Due diligence on a single deal often took days</li>
      <li>&bull; Analysts spent most of their time on data gathering, not analysis</li>
      <li>&bull; Time-sensitive opportunities were occasionally missed</li>
      <li>&bull; Research depth varied analyst to analyst</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Rapid Investment deployed Zunkiree's AI systems to pull together financials, market data, and risk signals into a single structured research pass per opportunity. Analysts now start from a synthesized baseline instead of raw source documents.
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Automated research synthesis</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Financials, filings, and market signals are pulled together into one structured brief per opportunity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Consistent due-diligence coverage</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Every deal gets the same depth of research, regardless of which analyst is running it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Faster time-to-decision</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Analysts move from raw data to a decision-ready view in a fraction of the time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The results</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
